menu "Storage"

config STM32_USE_STORAGE
	bool "Flash partition layer"
	default n
	depends on STM32_USE_DRIVERS
	help
	  Declarative flash partition map (#62): a constexpr table validated by
	  a consteval validator, in the spirit of Zephyr's flash_map but without
	  devicetree. Partitions are addressed by name, offsets inside a
	  partition are relative to it, and overlaps, unaligned boundaries and
	  out-of-range entries are compile errors.

	  Works over both the F4 internal flash (driver::IFlash) and an external
	  SPI flash such as the W25Q32; the external adapter states its own
	  structural requirements, so STM32_USE_SENSORS is not required.

endmenu
